ks out to $30K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.6M (3x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $2K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":54,"head":"Avoid: priced 233% above its fair value of $18.79.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 43, gates 11/24)","ROIC 21.5% vs WACC 8.5%","Revenue grew 12.2%/yr over 5y","P/FCF 7.9x vs sector 22.3x","Returns 6.2% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Trades 233% above fair value of $18.79","Net debt/EBITDA 3.1x","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/E 169.0x vs sector 23.3x","12-1 month momentum -48%"],"flags":["Priced 233% above its fair value of $18.79"],"need":[],"buy_below":15.98,"vc":{"base":18.79,"base_src":"dcf","bear":1.62,"bull":47.25,"alt_median":83.06,"n_alt":2,"gap":-0.7737,"dispersion":0.4808,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","models disagree (48% dispersion)","DCF is 77% below the other models' median ($83.06)","bull case is 29.2x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"BLDR","date":"2026-11-06"}